WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.316
What's the angle between the

2
00:00:02.316 --> 00:00:03.639
hands at 3:15?

3
00:00:03.639 --> 00:00:04.819
Not zero.

4
00:00:04.819 --> 00:00:06.334
Here's why.

5
00:00:06.665 --> 00:00:08.132
The minute hand moves 6

6
00:00:08.132 --> 00:00:09.497
degrees a minute.

7
00:00:09.497 --> 00:00:10.901
The hour hand moves half

8
00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:12.049
a degree a minute,

9
00:00:12.049 --> 00:00:14.034
so it creeps forward too.

10
00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:16.517
Angle equals 30 times the

11
00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:18.720
hour, minus 5.5 times the

12
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.794
minutes. Take the size,

13
00:00:20.794 --> 00:00:22.425
ignore the sign.

14
00:00:23.102 --> 00:00:25.086
30 times 3 is 90.

15
00:00:25.086 --> 00:00:28.882
5.5 times 15 is 82.5.

16
00:00:28.882 --> 00:00:30.934
So the angle is 7.5

17
00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:32.280
degrees.

18
00:00:32.645 --> 00:00:33.822
Your turn.

19
00:00:33.822 --> 00:00:35.479
What's the angle at nine

20
00:00:35.479 --> 00:00:36.511
o'clock?
